# Backend & Security Invariants
- Verify RBAC capabilities on every Server Action mutating data via `getUserPermissions()` from `@/lib/rbac`.
- Validate all incoming payloads with Zod schemas (`z.object({...})`).
- Wrap multi-entity updates in `prisma.$transaction([...])`.
- Check organization/status-page ownership to preserve multi-tenant boundary isolation.
- Sanitize HTML with `escapeHtml()` and URLs with `sanitizeUrl()`.
